This repository contains ports of, and test data from, other projects:

- The Hippogriff reference implementation (Owen Lynch; Apache-2.0):
  src/Heff/Core, src/Heff/Elab, src/Heff/Eval are ports of its modules; the
  programs of test/programs and test/errors are its golden tests,
  translated.
- fnotation (MPL-2.0): src/Heff/Parse/Notation.purs is from it and stays
  under MPL-2.0.
- diagnostician (Apache-2.0 OR MIT): the diagnostic format in
  src/Heff/Support/Diagnostic.purs follows it.
- prettyprinter (BSD-2-Clause): src/Heff/Support/Pretty.purs reimplements its
  layout algorithm.

No license has been chosen yet for the rest of this repository.
